-norris-mclaren-2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":318721,"altZh":"兰多·诺里斯：我的赛车不足以争夺F1冠军"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/lando-norris-i-dont-have-a-car-to-fight-for-the-f1-title/10848753/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-d115ee22898adbc8367665d3999c33ebddc493ad9b31517a104e2d83f336ba24","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"FIA解释荷兰大奖赛安全车编队圈，回应车手批评","summaryZh":"在赞德沃特举行的F1荷兰大奖赛开局阶段，因发车程序期间开始下雨而陷入混乱。红牛车手马克斯·维斯塔潘在比赛第一圈最后一个弯道出口处严重撞车，他承认这完全是自己的失误。荷兰人以为自己可以重新踩下油门，但赛道那一部分仍然湿滑。FIA随后解释了安全车编队圈的决定，以回应车手的批评。","publishedAt":"2026-08-25T14:59:15.031Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-23T18:38:28.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"autosport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Autosport","byline":"Autosport","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/6lmA9ND0/s6/race-start.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":320488,"altZh":"FIA解释荷兰大奖赛安全车编队圈，回应车手批评"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/it-made-no-sense-f1-drivers-question-safety-car-formation-lap-after-early-dutch-gp-chaos/10848760/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk","reason":null},"relatedSources":[{"publicId":"public-rss-668b867b6d924d134ceaaabca4d20e1fe4d02f1921be00aa4efa3f366501495e","sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","displayName":"Motorsport.com","originalUrl":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/it-made-no-sense-f1-drivers-question-safety-car-formation-lap-after-early-dutch-gp-chaos/10848751/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www"}]},{"publicId":"public-rss-57f6543f25466a4089e39b532e88ca2c8b5b851dcb1a92a4886ede19ccb1affc","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"安东内利：梅赛德斯“显然”不再是F1最强车队",